---@class posthog.marketing_analytics.Suggestion
---@field id string Stable identifier for this finding. Deterministic across scans, so clients can dedupe and remember dismissals by it.
---@field kind string Suggestion kind, e.g. connect_source / add_source_mapping
---@field source string 'deterministic' or 'ai' — how this suggestion was produced
---@field severity string error/warning/info
---@field confidence number 0-1. Never 1.0: these are inferences, not proofs.
---@field title string Short imperative title, e.g. 'Connect Meta Ads'
---@field evidence string The concrete numbers behind the suggestion, so a user can sanity-check it without taking it on faith
---@field unlocks posthog.marketing_analytics.SuggestionUnlocksList Capabilities this unblocks: cost, attribution, roas, cac
---@field apply any The operation that applies this suggestion, or null when there's nothing to automate. An object with an 'op' discriminator — see the ApplyOp union in setup_types. Pass it verbatim to apply_setup_ops; never hand-craft one.
---@field also_recommended posthog.marketing_analytics.SuggestionAlsoRecommendedList Advice shown alongside the action. Mapping suggestions always carry a 'fix_platform_urls' entry, because a mapping is a workaround and correcting the ad platform's tracking template is the real fix.
---@field safe_to_batch boolean True only for high-confidence, reversible operations — what an 'apply all safe' button may include
---@field rank_score number Ranking score; higher first. Unblocking actions dominate.
---@field integration string|distilled.Null Integration this concerns, if any
---@field deep_link string|distilled.Null In-app URL to resolve this manually, if any
---@field docs_url string|distilled.Null Documentation link, if any
---@field spend_at_risk number Ad spend currently mis- or un-attributed because of this
---@field event_volume number Events affected in the window

---Advice shown alongside the action. Mapping suggestions always carry a 'fix_platform_urls' entry, because a mapping is a workaround and correcting the ad platform's tracking template is the real fix.
---@alias posthog.marketing_analytics.SuggestionAlsoRecommendedList any[]

---Capabilities this unblocks: cost, attribution, roas, cac
---@alias posthog.marketing_analytics.SuggestionUnlocksList string[]

